      "family": "P1",
      "title": "Multi-module data pipeline migration",
      "goal": "The ingest pipeline is being moved to the v2 record contract. `pipeline/parsing.py` must produce validated records, `pipeline/normalise.py` must add the numeric field, `pipeline/aggregate.py` must sum those fields, `pipeline/store.py` must keep one record per name, `pipeline/api.py` must compose the whole path and `pipeline/report.py` must render it. The old v1 shape (`name`, `value`) stays the record shape; v2 adds `count` and fixes ordering, validation and duplicate handling. No public call site may lose behaviour it has today.",
